assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16/labels","id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","number":16,"title":"4.x","description":"Issues and pull requests slated for an undetermined Godot 4 release.","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":5790,"closed_issues":0,"state":"open","created_at":"2022-07-26T12:42:05Z","updated_at":"2026-10-22T08:16:48Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":null},"comments":0,"created_at":"2026-10-16T19:38:26Z","updated_at":"2026-10-17T12:03:19Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/124555","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124555","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124555.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/124555.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"<!--\nPlease target the `master` branch. We will take care of backporting relevant fixes to older versions.\n\nBefore submitting, please read our checklist for contributors:\nhttps://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/development/engine/introduction.html#checklist-for-new-contributors\n\nUse of AI must be disclosed and should include a description of how it was used.\n-->\n\n## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\n\nAnimation markers are not being cleared with everything else in `Animation::clear()`, which can lead to them persisting when they shouldn't.\n\n## Additional information\n\nThe problem is demonstrated with a simple script run with `--headless --script mrp.gd`\n\nmrp.gd:\n```\nextends SceneTree\n\nfunc _init() -> void:\n\tvar a := Animation.new()\n\ta.add_marker(\"m\", 1.0)\n\tvar b := Animation.new()\n\ta.copy_from_resource(b)\n\tprint(\"marker survived copy: \", a.has_marker(\"m\"))\n\tquit()\n```\n\nMarker \"m\" should be deleted on `a.copy_from_resource(b)` since \"b\" has no markers. Right now this script outputs \"marker survived copy: true\" since markers are not cleared with everything else in `clear()`.","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124555/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124555/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}